{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08489","headline":"奉饯高尊师如贵道士传道籙毕归北海 · 李白","name":"奉饯高尊师如贵道士传道籙毕归北海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道隐不可见，灵书藏洞天。\n吾师四万劫，历世遰相传。\n别杖留青竹，行歌蹑紫烟。\n离心无远近，长在玉京悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}